ils, SNS icons and headers, return gifts, neppuri, commercial use as merchandise, etc.).\nWe will clearly state your name when we use it.\n\nClothing and composition\nWe would like you to wear winter or spring clothes, or other casual attire appropriate for the time of delivery.\nHair style, composition, and facial expressions are up to the artist.\n\nSuccubus / 120 years old (about the age of an adult in the human world) / born of noble birth / tsundere / lots of PON elements / drinking and gambling / likes cute things, sweets, and roses.\n\nI have rose pink hair color, black mesh bangs, moon highlights in my eyes, a mole under my right eye, double teeth, a tattoo on my left collarbone, and a lewd crest under my belly button! (I try to keep the horns, overhead ring, wings, and tail out of the human world.)\n\n(Horns, rings on the head, wings and tails are not to be shown in the human world.\nThe color of the image is dark rose pink.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could deliver the image as a psd file with a separate background layer, character layer, and signature.\nWe would appreciate it if you could also provide us with facial expression differences.\n\nI apologize for pushing so many requests on you.\nI know you are busy, but I would appreciate your consideration.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/JehiPFkJspT7mHYB6", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ChalalaChan/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3356799, "client_id": 1950083, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e175eb2/uploads/origins/5d4aa887-89e0-4605-bd49-d04581390ab9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28af0c2c7a3d4e9250b08e64c8b8dbf3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6e175eb2/uploads/origins/5d4aa887-89e0-4605-bd49-d04581390ab9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=20